{
  "id": "ss.lib.face",
  "name": "Survivor face",
  "description": "The face every survivor wears, drawn for a head of radius four facing +x and lit from the upper left: two brows, two narrowed eyes with a glint in the near one, the shadow of a nose, and a closed mouth. Small, because at five heads tall a face is a few pixels, and serious, because these are people the hive is hunting. The hive has no eyes — it reads the world by scent — and a survivor whose organ has gone dead has nothing left to read with but these. Composed into every `ss.char.*` at the head's centre. The variants are expressions, and each survivor wears one.",
